=== pair_conflict ===
control: [Sub_axis; 40] and [1; 8] address one cell of an 8x32 buffer: true
flat [Sub;f] vs row-major [h;e] (8x32)                       query Cross_thread oracle overlap
flat [Sub;f<32] vs row 1 [1;e]: disjoint halves              query Cross_thread oracle disjoint
dynamic axis then iterator vs [i;j], thread j                query Same_thread  oracle same-thread
dynamic axis then [1] vs [2;1]: may meet                     query Cross_thread oracle overlap
dynamic axis then [1] vs [2;2]: never meet                   query Disjoint     oracle disjoint
flat vec [Sub;4c] run 4 vs [h;e] (2x8)                       query Cross_thread oracle overlap
flat vec [Sub;4c] run 4 vs cell [1;7]                        query Cross_thread oracle overlap
diagonal [i;i] vs flat [Sub;5]: off-diagonal                 query Disjoint     oracle disjoint
diagonal [i;i] vs flat [Sub;f]                               query Cross_thread oracle overlap
vec [i;4j] run 4 vs itself, thread i                         query Same_thread  oracle same-thread

=== separates ===
aligned vec [4i] run 4 separates i                           query true         oracle true
unaligned vec [2i] run 4 does not separate i                 query false        oracle false
trailing-lane vec [Sub;4c;Sub] run 4 separates c             query true         oracle true
dynamic [?;j] separates j                                    query true         oracle true
dynamic [?;j] does not separate i                            query false        oracle false
flat store [Sub;c] separates c                               query true         oracle true
diagonal [i;i] separates i                                   query true         oracle true

