[i;j+1] leaves 2x4                                           query false        oracle false
trailing [c;Sub] inside 3x2                                  query false        oracle true

=== covers_box ===
flat [Sub;c] covers 2x4                                      query false        oracle true
flat [Sub;2c] leaves holes in 2x4                            query false        oracle false
