[i;j] covers 2x4                                             query true         oracle true
diagonal [i;i] does not cover 3x3                            query false        oracle false

=== fiber_cardinality ===
flat [Sub;c] over c:8                                        query Exact 1
flat [Sub;c] over c:8, d:3 absent                            query Exact 3
flat [Sub;c+d] over c:4, d:4                                 query At_least 1
trailing-lane [Sub;4c;Sub] over c:4                          query Exact 1
